n31977.content:
\begin{corollary} \label{lem:herbrand_S-units}
	\uses{thm:Dirichlet_unit_theorem, lem:herbrand_ses, lem:herbrand_finite, lem:H2_cyclic_Z, lem:herbrand_log_lattice}
	Let $l/k$ be a cyclic extension. Then
